WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.169 --> 00:00:05.464
Adam:
The original Amazing Stories was
an iconic show. 

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:08.759
Adam:
The idea that there was a
Spielberg bit of magic

00:00:08.759 --> 00:00:10.677
Adam:
every week that would be in your
home

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:12.888
was like beyond comprehension as
a kid.

00:00:13.388 --> 00:00:14.389
Boy:
What is it?

00:00:14.389 --> 00:00:16.600
Well let's find out. 

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:18.685
Eddy:
What I love so much about
Amazing Stories 

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:21.438
is that it really opens up your
imagination.

00:00:22.231 --> 00:00:23.690
Eddy:
Every week you're in a different
world.

00:00:24.566 --> 00:00:25.651
Eddy:
Is it a ghost story?

00:00:25.651 --> 00:00:28.362
Eddy:
Is it an alien story, like you
just never know.

00:00:28.487 --> 00:00:30.822
And that was our goal for this
show.

00:00:30.822 --> 00:00:31.823
Boy:
Look!

00:00:33.617 --> 00:00:37.996
All the episodes have their own
themes and unique stories

00:00:37.996 --> 00:00:41.291
about what happens when the
ordinary touches the
extraordinary.

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:43.293
Boy:
He said he was from World War
II.

00:00:44.002 --> 00:00:45.045
Boy:
That's not possible, is it?

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:46.046
No, of course not.

00:00:46.588 --> 00:00:49.258
Justin:
These episodes represent every
walk of life.

00:00:50.509 --> 00:00:54.763
It's really an escape into a
world of wonder and possibility.

00:00:54.763 --> 00:00:58.350
There are these great adventure
stories.

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:00.018
Edward:
They have a lot of heart

00:01:00.018 --> 00:01:03.647
and they have a message beyond
the adventure at hand.

00:01:08.944 --> 00:01:11.280
Dylan:
I love that each episode you can
get 

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:14.408
wrapped up in an entirely new
world, entirely different story.

00:01:15.367 --> 00:01:16.994
Sam:
Maybe all this always happened.

00:01:16.994 --> 00:01:18.870
Maybe you were always meant to
come back with me.

00:01:19.037 --> 00:01:21.832
I think it's so cinematic
and epic.

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:25.419
Don't you feel different,
strong?

00:01:25.711 --> 00:01:30.841
These are stories that don't shy
away from complex human reality.

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:33.760
Someone's coming!

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:34.761
There are stories that move you,

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:36.263
stories about human
connection.

00:01:36.263 --> 00:01:37.264
We gotta go, now!

00:01:37.681 --> 00:01:39.558
It really makes your hair stand
on end.

00:01:40.017 --> 00:01:41.393
Car, move!

00:01:44.104 --> 00:01:47.190
We're bringing back that same
level of magic that people

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:49.318
got when they first started
watching Amazing Stories.

00:01:51.528 --> 00:01:53.989
It was so much fun to craft
these episodes.

00:01:53.989 --> 00:01:55.282
And Action!

00:01:55.449 --> 00:01:58.118
Adam:
To do a ghost story and
to do an alien story,

00:01:58.118 --> 00:02:01.413
Adam:
and to do a superhero story and
a time travel story and a romance.

00:02:01.413 --> 00:02:04.374
We're really excited now that
everyone's finally getting a
chance to see it.

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:09.338
Girl:
Study it all you want, the
answer isn't up there.

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:13.633
Woman:
It's not written in the stars.

00:02:13.633 --> 00:02:14.634
Woman:
You're in control.

00:02:15.427 --> 00:02:17.387
Sam:
Now, it's time for you to stop
looking.

00:02:17.888 --> 00:02:18.889
Announcer:
On your mark!

00:02:20.849 --> 00:02:21.975
Sam:
Your life is waiting.

00:02:22.601 --> 00:02:23.602
Announcer:
Set!

00:02:24.144 --> 00:02:25.562
Sam:
Go out there and get it.

00:02:25.562 --> 00:02:34.821
(Music)

00:02:34.821 --> 00:02:35.822
Sam:
It's your turn now.

